      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly with these proposed customizations, I'd eliminate the 'top left clickable buttons' (I have them memorized), move the 'top right Mute / face mirror / third person' to the bottom left, scale it up, and move the face mirror to the bottom center (so the webcam face tracking doesn't show me glancing to the side all the time to see my face). \n\nI would want it all in the bottom left like this to constrast well with my IkeHUD, which I also disabled all the elements on, except for coordinates/FPS/minimap in the bottom RIGHT corner. so these would go nice together! (albeit in different styles)\n\nI hope there will be snapping for the centerlines!\n\nEdit:\n\nOh! the tooltips appear on the HUD! I like that!\n\nThat would go above my bottom left corner hud, I think.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
